certified_type:
  category: Indicator
  type_designations:
  - AFS
  - AFM
  - ABM
  - ATM
  - APS
  - VFS
  - VFM
  - VBM
  - VTM
  - VPS
  module_designation:
  description: >-
    Family of digital indicators (A-Series and V-Series) connected to a weighing platform forming a Class
    III or IIII, mains or battery-powered, self-indicating, single interval or dual interval/range, non-automatic
    weighing instrument; may be used for direct sales to the public. Stainless steel enclosure (AFS, APS,
    VFS, VPS) or plastic enclosure (AFM, ATM, ABM, VFM, VBM, VTM); 2.0-inch graphic LCD (1.0-inch on APS
    and VPS); A/D conversion module and main board with processor. Devices include initial and semi-automatic
    zero setting, zero tracking, semi-automatic subtractive tare balancing, determination of stability
    of equilibrium, zero indicator, net indicator, memory and totalisation, and printing. Load cells must
    have an OIML R60 Certificate of Conformity with the necessary data for the manufacturer's declaration
    of compatibility; load cells marked NH are allowed only if humidity testing to R76 was conducted on
    them; compatibility of load cell and indicator is established via the compatibility of modules calculation
    at verification. Legally relevant parameters protected by a jumper on the main board; enclosures and
    load cell connection sealed using a wire-and-seal method.
